# --- arrays: the line (the characters and the first four tokens: value, & first, text, 2nd and 3rd characters, length), the layers of a
# block as units (what the text has: kind 0 empty row, 1 copy, 2 four numbers; the numbers n d s, the kinds of d and s: 0 number, 1 table
# of the library, 2 other label; the position in the text, the texts of the labels), the ops (a unit that is not empty), their bits read and
# written, their layers; the layers of the new block (rows, slots, widths, starts)
:lb array 6 8
:tn array 2 20
:tlk array 2 1
:tta array 2 64
:ttb array 2 64
